{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーけーいけーオレオレー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/10/0000%20%281%29.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、東北楽天ゴールデンイーグルスvs北海道日本ハムファイターズの\n始球式を、乃木坂46がやらせていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ドーーーム！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でかかったぁ...目がまんまるになっちゃったよ！！！(⊙◞౪◟⊙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のガールズルールも生ちゃんポジションで踊らせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ私が生ちゃんに見えてきた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやそれはない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見事楽天イーグルスさん勝利しました❤\nこれは本当に本当にうれしすぎるっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうございます本当にっ！！\n少しでも少しでもあみ達が勝利に貢献出来てたらなあと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、人生で初めて野球試合を生で見たんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選手の皆さんムッキムキで素晴らしかった！なんていうかキラキラして見えた(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり頑張ってる人は輝いてますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/10/4637283/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみももっともっとキラキラ輝けるように頑張らなくちゃいけないね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのためにまずは何を始めてみようかな。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"腹筋3回くらいやって...ちょっとその場で小刻みにジャンプしてみよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/10/4637283/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度、ファンの皆様とのお茶会とやらをやるらしいではないか！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お、お茶？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ティー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュースじゃだめなの？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噂によるとトランプとかやるらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ト、トランプ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人狼ゲームじゃだめなの❤？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる？人狼ゲーム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人数だったら間違いなく盛り上がるイギリスのゲーム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごいおもちろいんだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/10/4637283/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていうかショート...懐かしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ見てやはり我は能條のショートがいいんだよって思った方...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみませぬ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたくし、ただいまロングを楽しんでおります。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/07/10/4637283/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}